# Core paths: the files a session running unattended may never change
# (joharness.sh:protocol_paths). Everything else — protocol text included —
# a session edits and self-merges since 2026-10-08.
#
# This file is the GUARANTEE, the list in joharness.sh only the early
# warning: a session may edit joharness.sh, so it could drop an entry there.
# It cannot merge a change to a path owned here while main's branch
# protection requires code-owner review — an operator setting, not a file.
# `/.github/` covers this file itself.
/joharness.conf         @chrsctl
/.claude/settings.json  @chrsctl
/.github/               @chrsctl
